---
import TreatmentLayout from '../../components/TreatmentLayout.astro';
import PriceBlock from '../../components/PriceBlock.astro';
import { foilHighlights, capHighlights } from '../../data/services';
import { images } from '../../data/images';
---

<TreatmentLayout
  title="Highlights / Lowlights"
  metaTitle="Highlights and lowlights, toner included"
  description="Foil highlights from €85 and cap highlights from €59 at Maison Coiffure, always including a finishing toner. Lowlights are planned personally in consultation."
  lede="Light, dimension and depth, with the finishing toner included in every price."
  image={images.highlightsBlonde}
  ctaLabel="Book a colour consultation"
  waMessage="Hello Maison Coiffure, I would like to book a Colour and Highlight Consultation for highlights."
>
  <p>
    Foil highlights create carefully placed lighter sections and dimension throughout the hair. Cap
    highlights create evenly distributed fine highlights and suit short hair and bobs that remain
    above the shoulders. In both cases a finishing toner is an essential part of the treatment,
    included in the displayed price and the reserved time, so the result is refined rather than
    unfinished.
  </p>
  <p>
    Lowlights add depth instead of light. They are planned personally: in your consultation we look
    at your current colour, condition and desired result and agree the right combination, time and
    estimate. Lowlights also play a role in the
    <a href="/treatments/grey-hair">Gracefully Grey</a> transition plans.
  </p>
  <p>
    A consultation is required before your first highlight treatment; the €25 fee is fully deducted
    from the agreed treatment.
  </p>

  <Fragment slot="after">
    <PriceBlock group={foilHighlights} headingLevel="h2" />
    <PriceBlock group={capHighlights} headingLevel="h2" />
  </Fragment>
</TreatmentLayout>
